  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/HTTYD_Berk_Island/MP_HTTYDBerkIsland_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"900\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🌟 <strong>馴龍高手：博克島</strong> 🏝️<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">展開一場以傳奇世界《馴龍高手》為靈感的史詩級 Minecraft 冒險！🎬🔥<br>這個模組包將帶你體驗豐富的中世紀奇幻世界，維京人、龍族與危險主宰著博克島的天空與大地。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/HTTYD_Berk_Island/MP_HTTYDBerkIsland_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></p>\n<span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">👣 你的旅程從一名年輕維京人開始，漂流到博克島的荒野海岸。像真正的村民一樣收集物資、打獵求生……但心中只有一個目標：找到並馴服你的第一條龍。🔥🪓</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">📜 透過引導式的任務線，逐步從在博克島生存的第一天，成長為真正的龍騎士。完成任務以解鎖新機制、獲得獎勵，並按自己的節奏發現強大的龍族、頭目與隱藏地點。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🌍 探索一個精心打造的世界，充滿中世紀建築、古代維京遺跡、龍巢與等待被發現的隱藏地點。深入危險的地城，發掘失落的寶藏，並面對將考驗你力量、策略與勇氣的強大頭目。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">⚔️ 製作並揮舞中世紀武器、盾牌與盔甲，鍛造配得上真正龍騎士的裝備，並準備好與以夜煞、致命納德龍等許多駭人猛獸為靈感的傳說生物展開史詩對決。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🏰 建造並擴張你自己的維京村莊，抵禦持續的威脅，崛起成為博克的傳奇戰士。捕捉、馴服並收集你能找到的每一種龍族，用強大而威嚴的龍群充實你的村莊，然後騎上忠誠的夥伴翱翔天際，主宰陸地、海洋與天空。🐲🔥</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">👥 專為單人冒險與多人遊戲設計，這個模組包提供了成長、挑戰、探索與史詩級戰鬥。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>準備好和朋友一起玩了嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore%253fr%253dhttyd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/HTTYD_Berk_Island/MP_HTTYDBerkIsland_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"350\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">立即建立你自己的 Minecraft 伺服器，與朋友一起展開史詩旅程！享受強勁效能、穩定運行時間與無憂體驗。別忘了使用優惠碼&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VOXELCORE </a>，即可在伺服器上享有<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">75折優惠</a>！</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/HTTYD_Berk_Island/MP_HTTYDBerkIsland_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2800\" height=\"230\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1278774/description_21f065d2-c7fe-4bab-90b2-df84c1045c28.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1278774/description_d643c6a3-7594-4de6-a9c9-54f0cc02e392.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1278774/description_48d95f7d-622d-4a79-806a-c516af09460a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4qZvzDYgGT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/HTTYD_Berk_Island/MP_HTTYDBerkIsland_discord.webp\" width=\